@baseUrl = https://localhost:7132
@token = paste-token-from-login-response

### Login: seeded development account only
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"owner@morningbrew.test","password":"MorningBrew!2026"}

### Current account and assigned branches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scoped customer list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/customers?skip=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke current session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
